(BRIGHTWATER MILLS LTD) Tj T*
(IT Steering Committee Ц minutes of the meeting held on 14 July 2026) Tj T*
(CONFIDENTIAL. Internal use only. Do not forward outside Brightwater Mills.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Present: Helen Ward \(Operations Director, chair\), Raj Patel \(IT Manager\), Tom Okafor) Tj T*
(\(Finance Controller\), Ana Silva \(Quality Lead\).) Tj T*
(Apologies: none.) Tj T*
(Agenda: 1. Production planning. 2. Quality data. 3. Orders and finance. 4. Plant) Tj T*
(infrastructure. 5. Any other business.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Production planning) Tj T*
(Raj Patel: The production planning tool MillPlan schedules every milling run. MillPlan) Tj T*
(sends the daily production plan to the plant control system at 05:00 each morning.) Tj T*
(Helen Ward asked whether the plan can be changed after it is sent.) Tj T*
(Raj Patel: Changes after 05:00 are phoned through to the shift supervisor and are not) Tj T*
(recorded in MillPlan.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Quality data) Tj T*
(Ana Silva: Every batch is tested in the lab before it is released. Lab results are) Tj T*
(recorded in LabTrack. LabTrack is a spreadsheet-based tool, and it is maintained by one) Tj T*
(person in the quality team.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
