(3. Orders and finance) Tj T*
(Tom Okafor: Sales orders and invoices are held in LedgerOne, the ERP we rent from the) Tj T*
(vendor. The ERP pushes confirmed sales orders into MillPlan every hour.) Tj T*
(Raj Patel confirmed that the hourly order feed has failed twice this year without) Tj T*
(anyone noticing until the next morning.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Plant infrastructure) Tj T*
(Raj Patel: The plant control system runs on two servers on the mill floor. One of the) Tj T*
(two servers is out of vendor support.) Tj T*
(Decision: IT will propose a replacement for LabTrack by the end of Q1 2027.) Tj T*
(Decision: IT will price a supported replacement for the mill floor server.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Any other business) Tj T*
(None.) Tj T*
ET
